 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-2396 with Advisor/Governor/Phase/Registry/Store/
  Operation/Sim (mirrors cloud-itonami-isic-2393 module-for-module, adapted
  from porcelain/ceramic-products to dimension-stone fabrication --
  stonemfg.* namespace, Dimension Stone Plant Operations Governor):
  - Governor: eleven concrete HARD checks elaborating four HARD invariants
    (propose-only effect, closed op allowlist, closed proposal-effect
    allowlist / no direct sawing-line/polishing-line control, permanent
    sawing-polishing-line-actuate block) plus a confidence/high-stakes
    escalation gate (SOFT, human may approve)
  - Registry: pure functions -- equipment/batch verified+registered gates,
    shipment-weight-exceeded recompute, product-type-valid? (8-member closed
    set: granite/marble/limestone/sandstone slab, monument, countertop,
    dimension-stone-tile, cut-stone-veneer), slab-thickness-tolerance-valid?
    (-20.0 to 20.0mm), polish-gloss-level-valid? (0-100 gloss units) --
    replacing 2393's glaze-defect-rate-percent/chip-resistance-newtons pair
  - Store: Store protocol + MemStore (SSoT + append-only audit ledger,
    sample batches/equipment seeded for offline tests/demo)
  - Advisor: StoneAdvisor -- deterministic mock (default) + llm-advisor
    (langchain.model-backed, same proposal-EDN contract)
  - Phase: 0->3 rollout gate, :schedule-maintenance permanently absent from
    every phase's :auto set (structural, not a milestone)
  - Operation: StoneOperationActor -- full langgraph-clj StateGraph
    (advise -> govern -> decide -> commit|hold|request-approval), real
    interrupt-before/resume approval workflow
  - Sim: demo runner (-main) exercising all four happy paths + ten HARD-hold
    scenarios directly
  - Ops (closed allowlist, all :effect :propose): log-production-batch
    (product-type/weight/slab-thickness-tolerance/polish-gloss-level data
    logging), schedule-maintenance (sawing/polishing-line-equipment
    maintenance scheduling), flag-safety-concern (equipment-safety/
    crystalline-silica-dust-exposure -- ALWAYS escalates), coordinate-shipment
    (outbound slab/monument shipment coordination)
  - Tests: 75 tests / 210 assertions across
    governor-contract/operation/phase/registry/store-contract, all green
  - All .cljc (portable, no JVM interop), AGPL-3.0-or-later
  - GitHub repo created directly as cloud-itonami-isic-2396 (no rename
    needed)"

